      "description": "An electrifying, intimate and fun musical experience like no other. For the past few years Hidden Jazz Club has been the place for Londoners in the know to discover the best of the city’s jazz scene within a unique setting. Completely artist-run, fun, spontaneous, and relaxed, this is not like your parents’ jazz club. Hidden Jazz Club is the type of space where guests are able to relax and connect with world class artists between sets of amazing live music.",
